      "content": "thanks for the advice. the thing is, the \"official\" archives are basically the ones controlled by the descendants of the council that took the land, so they'll never have the records i need. i've already been looking through private collections and i'm almost certain i have the proof, but i need to frame it in a way that doesn't just make me look like a conspiracy theorist. i want to write a manifesto that basically calls for a digital restoration of the von Altendorf name. how can i structure a document like that so it carries authority and forces people to take the claim seriously?",
